## WoT Server Reticle Toggle v1.0.0

Initial release.

### Features
- Toggle World of Tanks Server Reticle with F9
- Uses the game's native `useServerAim` setting
- Shows ON/OFF status above the minimap
- Green notification when enabled
- Red notification when disabled
- Saves the changed setting

### Tested with
World of Tanks 2.3.1.2

### Installation
Copy `promiseofapocalypse.server_reticle_toggle_1.0.0.wotmod` to:

`World_of_Tanks_EU/mods/<game-version>/`


if you want to use customizable buttons, please create mods/configs/promise/serverAimToggle.json

with this content:
{
  "enabled": true,
  "hotkey": ["KEY_LALT", "KEY_B"],
  "persist": false
}

!! Big thanks to OldSkool (Promod modpack developer) for pointing me to some great ideas !! 